title: "Ussuri River freshwater-fish eDNA: analysis code and data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code and derived data for a 12S environmental-DNA metabarcoding study of the
  freshwater fish community of the Ussuri River (Amur basin), covering composition, alpha and beta
  diversity, taxonomic-functional coupling, and the longitudinal hydro-geographic gradient.
